<title>CANADA: Canada bond trading seen closing at 1400 EST today.</title>
<headline>Canada bond trading seen closing at 1400 EST today.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Toronto Bond Traders' Association said on Monday it recommended an early close today for Canada's bond market at 1400 EST/1900 GMT.</p>
<p>Canadian markets were lightly staffed due to the Remembrance Day government and bank holiday. U.S. bond markets were closed for Veterans Day.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
